//     site remembered, then to the workspace's own public webhook (N8);
//   * an explicit webhook_url that was sent and REJECTED (ftp://, embedded
//     credentials, private host…) leaves the form DISCONNECTED and says so in
//     input_warnings — misconfiguration must be visible, never silently
//     rerouted somewhere the owner did not ask for.
